BEGIN

   BEGIN is used to start a DynamoDB transaction. A group of DML commands can be executed as a single transaction.
   For example:
      BEGIN;
      SELECT * FROM TBL1 where <primary key condition>;
      SELECT * FROM TBL2 where <primary key condition>;
      COMMIT;

      BEGIN;
      UPDATE ...;
      DELETE ...;
      COMMIT;
   This will perform the update and the delete as a single transaction.

   Transactions are committed with a COMMIT, and can be canceled with a ROLLBACK.

